    <tags>git git-client git-gui source-control version-control winui admin</tags>
    <summary>A git client for Windows, built with WinUI 3.</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[
Gitxen is a free, open-source git client for Windows with a WinUI 3 interface.

* Staged and unstaged changes, with hunk-level staging, discard, amend and sign-off
* A commit graph with ref badges, client-side filtering and a real `git log` search
* Branches, remotes, tags, stashes, submodules and worktrees
* Reflog recovery, and conflict resolution with a merge tool or by hand
* Several repositories open at once, as tabs or as a left-hand column

Gitxen is a derivative work of [Git Extensions](https://github.com/gitextensions/gitextensions) and
is distributed under the same GPL-3.0 licence. It is not endorsed by or affiliated with that project.

#### Notes

The installer is machine-wide and adds `gitxen` to `PATH`. It carries its own copies of the .NET
runtime and the Windows App SDK, so nothing else has to be installed first.
]]></description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/dev-kakosoai/gitextensions/releases/tag/{{RELEASE_TAG}}</releaseNotes>
  </metadata>
  <files>
